id: pm-gh1370
title: "GH-1370: validate transaction previews against staged lifecycle state"
description: "Implement existing https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1370. Share lifecycle validation through isolated staged state while preserving original tracker data and actual commit concurrency checks."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-01T10:36:55.000Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-02T12:23:02.654Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-02T12:23:01.746Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-02T12:23:01.746Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Invalid enums and missing IDs refuse previews with apply-compatible diagnostics;Strict completion validates staged evidence;Preview changes no source items history or journals;Existing rollback and replay controls remain green
parent: pm-y9hq
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Validate ordered mutations in owned disposable state, retain schema/context/session inputs, disclose committed replay, and preserve source/global bytes through actual parser startup and cleanup while ordinary apply retains preparation."
expected_result: "Structured CLI and SDK previews validate ordered mutations through staged lifecycle state while preserving source/global durable bytes and reporting committed replay honestly; normal apply retains schema hydration, pending migrations, consent and telemetry preparation, including package-augmented option parsing."
actual_result: "Temporary three-step preview preserves source hashes and actual apply reaches closed; committed replay is validated=false with replayed_committed_plan; missing contained absolute schema is staged only, external schema refuses with usage2 and unchanged bytes. Required-value, namespace, parser-error and inherited-consent controls pass; isolated reversion detects real consent and tracker-arity failures. Final corrected source: producing receipt test-local-muqw5il0-81bh9y passes 9591 cases, zero failures, two Windows-only skips and exact100/100/100/100 across760 coverage files (lines63301, statements66369, functions13726, branches50811 all fully covered; summarySHA256 80c472e674c90ef42cdb09b8806ed9a5a5729af294f6679afc33f11d5329401c). All1452 frozen authoring/config/test/doc digests remain unchanged. Focused seven-owner228-case CLI/SDK contracts and temporary manual current-artifact acceptance pass. Canonical type/ESLint/SDK-boundary proof passes; complete static prefix passes source/docs/duplicates/contracts/error catalogs/workflow/agent-context47/gate-registry/public-surface checks. Node24.12 official SDK import admission passes. Matched official CLItransport baseline16bb/current controls both pass all six unchanged latency/RSS budgets with10 measured samples per command; no cause for earlier failed samples is established. Canonical test-local-muqxn5c3-9l1c4s passes graph-composition9 assertions (prose gaps1236 at unchanged ceiling), record-integrity1 assertion and bounded mutation329 killed/336 with seven existing declared equivalents. Failed coverage/performance/static attempts remain failed. Current context/package receipt test-local-muqt3kve-ua5tys passes58 token/context surfaces,89 package-first commands, nine packed npx/bunx packages and artifact19981526<20000000bytes. Registrypositive164/164 members across55 lineages/112edges passes; synthetic unregistered two-member negativecontrol correctly fails. This closes verified implementation for the reviewed PR; exact final-head hosted reviews/checks, merge, main workflows and registry publication remain separate pending stages."
